        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitoomono Esta olaiguanani o Haman meinosa osirua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e uni neishop Esta nkilani enyena e nkitoo neitashe ti atua olgoriet le nkaji o laiguanani, oipirakinore ina aji o laiguanani. Neton olaiguanani to lorika lenye le nkitoo ti atua enkaji e nkitoo aipirakinore kutukaji e nkaji e nkitoo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edol olaiguanani Esta eitashe to lgoriet, netum ninye Esta omom too nkonyek enyena neitarasaki ninye Esta ina ng'udi e sahabu apa naata te nkaina enye. Nelotu Esta ayiaya neibung endukuya e ina ng'udi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani ninye, “Kainyoo Esta? Kainyoo eomonunoto ino? Eikinchori iyie, o metabaiki olpisiai le nkitoria ai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Esta, “Tenaa keishiaakino to laiguanani, nchoo olaiguanani o Haman epuonu osirua taata laitobiraka nanu olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olaiguanani, Eyau Haman entasieku, pee kitum aataas anaa enayieu Esta.” Nelotu olaiguanani o Haman ilo sirua oitobira Esta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eokito enaisho oo sabibu, nejoki olaiguanani Esta, “Kainyoo olkiyioi lino? Eikinchori iyie. Naa kainyoo eomonunoto ino? Tenaa duoo ninye kolpisiai le nkitoria ai, naa keitabari ake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etejo Esta, “Ore enkolat ai o eomonunoto ai naa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenaa kanoto nanu omom too nkonyek o laiguanani, naa tenaa keitiship olaiguanani meishoru enkolat neitabaya eomonunoto ai, nchoo olaiguanani o Haman epuonu taisere osirua layooki aitobiraki ninche, ore taisere naas anaa enatejo olaiguanani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitobira Haman pee ear Mordekai metua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipang Haman ina olong alo eng'ida neshipa to ltau. Kake ore ake pee edol Haman Mordekai te nkishomi o laiguanani, nchere eitu eitashe neitu eikirikira te dukuya ninye neiput engoro te nkaraki Mordekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia eibooyie Haman keon, nelo ang, neirriwaa meipoti ilchoreta lenyena o enkitok enye Seresh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinosaki Haman ninche esikar o enkarsisisho enye, esiana oo layiok lenyena o enkitoo pooki naishoo ninye olaiguanani o ina nailepieki ninye aaitalang ilkituaak o laisiaayiak lo laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Haman aponaa ajo, “Ore ninye Esta enkitok o laiguanani eitu eisho hoo ng'ae meeu te nebo olaiguanani ilo sirua oitobira ninye meteleku nanu ake. Naa ore sii taisere aaitoomono ninye te nebo olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eyia, maaitiship kuna pooki te nadol Mordekai ilo Yahudi eton te nkishomi o laiguanani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki enkitok enye Seresh o lchoreta lenyena pooki, “Nchoo eitayuni olchani ogorishoreki intemat onom enkadoro ore taisere tadekenya niliki olaiguanani pee eiki Mordekai te nchumata e ilo shani. Nijing, iyie osirua lo laiguanani te ng'ida.” Neitiship ina walata Haman, neisho meitobiri olchani ogorishoreki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
